WEBVTT

00:19:55.621 --> 00:20:00.163
and just finished writing. Our advice
is not to do without intuition.

00:20:00.163 --> 00:20:05.746
It is to delay it. That is, it
is not to decide prematurely.

00:20:06.788 --> 00:20:11.163
And not to have intuitions very early,
if you can delay your intuitions,

00:20:11.663 --> 00:20:15.329
I think they're are your best guide
probably about what you should be doing.

00:20:17.204 --> 00:20:20.579
OK, so two questions there. One
is how the other is why,

00:20:21.621 --> 00:20:24.996
well, you delay your intuitions, you know.

00:20:25.871 --> 00:20:27.996
No, I'm talking about formal decisions,

00:20:27.996 --> 00:20:32.996
decisions that might be taken within
an organization or a decision that